          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: The GEIPAN received a concise testimony of a peculiar observation made on September 16, 2009. A single witness observed the rapid passage towards the North of a luminous phenomenon that changed trajectory several times. The phenomenon disappeared towards the N-W. Despite our follow-ups, no additional information was gathered about this phenomenon, making any investigation impossible.",
